"Stars: HYG Database v4.1 (CC BY-SA 4.0). Constellation lines: d3-celestial (BSD). Planets: JPL approximate elements. Digitized Sky Survey – STScI/NASA, coloured and tiled by CDS, served by NASA/IPAC IRSA. Two Micron All Sky Survey (2MASS) – University of Massachusetts and IPAC/Caltech, funded by NASA and NSF; coloured and tiled by CDS, served by NASA/IPAC IRSA.": "별: HYG Database v4.1 (CC BY-SA 4.0). 별자리 선: d3-celestial (BSD). 행성: JPL 근사 궤도 요소. Digitized Sky Survey – STScI/NASA, CDS가 색을 입히고 타일로 나눔, NASA/IPAC IRSA가 제공. Two Micron All Sky Survey (2MASS) – 매사추세츠대학교와 IPAC/Caltech, NASA와 NSF 후원. CDS가 색을 입히고 타일로 나눔, NASA/IPAC IRSA가 제공.",
